.i .i'e .ie xamgu te rinsa
I support, I agree, it's a good way of greeting.

.i mi nelci lo nu rinsa lo pendo lo nu cusku zo pei
I like to greet a friend by saying "pei".

.i pe'i pendo xendo
I think it's a friendly kind of kind.

.i su'a lo nu lo jbopre cu rinsa fi lo nu te preti cu cafne
Generalizing, a Lojbanist greeting by asking a question happens often.

.i le se preti cu vrici .a'u
The things asked about are various-- interesting!

.i ko preti lo se kucli be do .e'a
Ask about what you're curious about, you have my permission.

